  <p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">The 2024 annual meeting of stockholders (the &#8220;Annual Meeting&#8221;) of American Well Corporation (the &#8220;Company&#8221;) was held on June 18, 2024. The Company previously filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission a definitive proxy statement and related materials pertaining to the Annual Meeting, which describe in detail each of the four proposals submitted to stockholders at the Annual Meeting. The final results for the votes regarding each proposal are set forth below.</span></p>
  <p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p>
